Dialogs = Array[String](["Hey, you look like you could use some help!", "I'm Puffy McPufferson, and I happen to be GREAT at breathing excercises!", "They can really help when you're feeling overwhelmed and stressed.", "Slowly take a deep breath where your belly fills up and hold it for 10 seconds. Then, sloooowly release it like you're blowing out  a straw."])
